{{page dlc|a}}
A '''closet''' is a rare, small, dead-end room added in ''[[The Binding of Isaac: Afterbirth]]''. Closets often contain a unique arrangement of objects, pickups, items, or enemies, but are otherwise identical in appearance to normal rooms. Each [[chapter]] has several closet layouts, some differing between stages themselves. Some closets are considerably more rare than others, but also often contain more powerful loot or enemies.<!-- rare = weight 0.1, uncommon = 0.25 or 0.5, common = 1.0 -->

A normal small corridor can also generate in a dead-end location or have a secret room at its other end, appearing like a closet, but these are not covered in this article.

